<section id="destinations"><div class="wrap"><div class="head"><div><div class="kicker">Start somewhere</div><h2>Explore destinations</h2></div><p>Browse a starter collection of Indian favourites. Open any guide for highlights, suggested stays, travel notes and map links.</p></div><div class="search"><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Search destinations, regions or experiences…" aria-label="Search destinations"></div><div class="filters"><button class="filter active" data-filter="all">All places</button><button class="filter" data-filter="beach">Beaches</button><button class="filter" data-filter="heritage">Heritage</button><button class="filter" data-filter="mountain">Mountains</button><button class="filter" data-filter="nature">Nature</button><button class="filter" id="savedFilter">♡ Saved (<span id="savedCount">0</span>)</button></div><div class="grid" id="destinationGrid"></div></div></section>

<section id="stays" style="background:#eee8dc"><div class="wrap"><div class="head"><div><div class="kicker">Rest well, travel better</div><h2>Stay ideas</h2></div><p>Examples of well-known accommodation options to research. Check current rates, location, facilities and guest reviews directly before booking.</p></div><div class="featuregrid" id="stayHighlights"></div><p class="notice">Hotel names are discovery suggestions, not live availability or endorsements. OUTOFLANE does not currently take hotel bookings or verify current room prices.</p></div></section>

<section id="experiences"><div class="wrap"><div class="head"><div><div class="kicker">Make it memorable</div><h2>Experiences to look for</h2></div><p>Build your itinerary around culture, food, nature and the people who make each place special.</p></div><div class="featuregrid"><div class="feature"><b>Local food walks</b><p>Explore regional dishes, markets and food traditions with reputable local guides.</p></div><div class="feature"><b>Heritage & culture</b><p>Visit museums, historic neighbourhoods, craft centres and monuments respectfully.</p></div><div class="feature"><b>Nature escapes</b><p>Choose marked trails, authorised operators and activities suited to local conditions.</p></div><div class="feature"><b>Slow travel</b><p>Spend more time in fewer places and support independent local businesses.</p></div><div class="feature"><b>Photography spots</b><p>Find scenic viewpoints while respecting private property and site rules.</p></div><div class="feature"><b>Community experiences</b><p>Look for responsible experiences led by local communities and verified providers.</p></div></div></section>

<section class="dark" id="planner"><div class="wrap"><div class="head"><div><div class="kicker">Make it happen</div><h2>Plan your journey</h2></div><p>Use this simple estimator to sketch a starting budget. It is an estimate, not a quote.</p></div><div class="planner"><div class="quote">A good trip begins with a little planning and a lot of <em>curiosity.</em></div><div class="formbox"><label for="place">Destination</label><select id="place"><option>Goa</option><option>Jaipur</option><option>Manali</option><option>Kerala</option><option>Udaipur</option><option>Rishikesh</option></select><label for="people">Number of travellers</label><input id="people" type="number" min="1" max="20" value="2"><label for="days">Number of days</label><input id="days" type="number" min="1" max="30" value="4"><label for="style">Travel style</label><select id="style"><option value="budget">Budget</option><option value="mid" selected>Comfort</option><option value="premium">Premium</option></select><button class="btn primary" style="width:100%;margin-top:17px" onclick="estimate()">Estimate my budget</button><div class="result" id="estimate">₹ —</div><p class="small" id="estimateNote">Select your trip details to get a rough estimate.</p></div></div></div></section>

<section id="about"><div class="wrap split"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476514525535-07fb3b4ae5f1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=85" alt="Mountain lake and travel landscape"><div><div class="kicker">Our point of view</div><h2 style="font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,48px);letter-spacing:-2px">Travel with intention.</h2><p>OUTOFLANE is a travel discovery concept made for curious explorers. We bring destination inspiration, practical planning notes and stay ideas into one simple place.</p><p>Our aim is to encourage thoughtful travel: learn about local culture, respect nature, support local businesses and check important details before you go.</p><div class="chips"><span class="chip">Discover</span><span class="chip">Plan</span><span class="chip">Explore responsibly</span></div></div></div></section>

<section id="contact" style="background:#eee8dc"><div class="wrap contact"><div><div class="kicker">Say hello</div><h2 style="font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,48px);letter-spacing:-2px">Let's talk travel.</h2><p>Have a destination suggestion, correction or collaboration idea? Send a message to the OUTOFLANE team.</p><p><b>Email:</b> <a href="mailto:outoflane1@gmail.com">outoflane1@gmail.com</a></p></div><form class="contactform" onsubmit="sendEnquiry(event)"><label for="name">Your name</label><input id="name" required placeholder="Name"><label for="email">Your email</label><input id="email" type="email" required placeholder="you@example.com"><label for="message">Message</label><textarea id="message" required placeholder="Tell us what's on your mind…"></textarea><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Prepare email ↗</button><p class="small" style="color:var(--muted)">This opens your email app with a draft. It does not send or store your message on this website.</p></form></div></section>
